Close Quarters Fighting is an advanced brawling technique that enhances a
warrior's effectiveness in tight, chaotic melee situations. When enemies
press in from all sides and there is no room for fancy footwork, trained
brawlers know how to turn the confined space to their advantage.

This skill improves both offensive and defensive capabilities when fighting
multiple opponents or in cramped quarters. Practitioners learn to use
elbows, knees, and short punches effectively when longer weapons would be
unwieldy.

The effects of this skill are handled automatically during combat. Higher
learning provides greater bonuses when fighting conditions favor close-in
brawling.

Class: Warrior
Discipline: Brawling

